WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.150
Two family trees, side by side.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.740
On the left, a royal household:
father, mother, uncle, son.

3
00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:13.340
On the right, a minister's:
father, son, daughter.

4
00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:15.400
A mirror slides between them.

5
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.560
Lines start to match: a
father lost on each side.

6
00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:22.530
A son who wants revenge on each side.

7
00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.180
But the daughter's circle has no match.

8
00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.920
Polonius's family mirrors Hamlet's.

9
00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:30.210
So what does the mirror show?

10
00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:34.700
In this mission, you'll meet Polonius,
who tells his son "to thine own self be

11
00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:37.520
true", then has him spied on.

12
00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:40.310
You'll follow Ophelia's
story, scene by scene,

13
00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:42.070
through to her madness.

14
00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:45.420
And you'll meet Laertes,
the other revenger.

15
00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:48.530
Your mission: work out
what the mirror shows.
